\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-270\li270\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.  \cf0  Prepare in you a new heart now,
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0 The Lord our God declares.
\par The Kingdom of the Lord is near
\par and is down on this earth.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-270\li270\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par   2.   All acts of sins we do commit
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0 Jesus forgives us all
\par The Lamb of God, the Lord of Host
\par Has taken all away.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-270\li270\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par   3.   Yes, God gave out His only Son
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0 To die to save us all.
\par So that we may not get perished
\par But has saved us from sin.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  4.   He has prepared a place for us
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0 for our eternity
\par Truly, our God loves us so well
\par and He loves all the world.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-270\li270\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  5.  So then, do let us all repent
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0 And hate all forms of sin
\par Let us return to our maker
\par Our heavenly Father.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-270\li270\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  6.   O, change me, change me O my God
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0 forgive me all my sins
\par O, take me back as your own son
\par \pard     and let me be honoured. \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

